<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
the year ended December 31, 2021, cash used in investing activities was $11.6 million, consisting of investment in short-term deposits
of $11 million and purchases of property and equipment of $0.6 million.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in; background-color: white"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">During
