    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F12_zyWtQvIgSP02" style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000569" xml:lang="en-US">During
