    services revenues and related development costs that had been previously deferred, in the amounts of $<span id="xdx_900_eus-gaap--DevelopmentCosts_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--ServiceMember_ztTaUNEcNuw7" title="Development costs" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtICBTQ0hFRFVMRSBPRiBESVNBR0dSRUdBVElPTiBPRiBSRVZFTlVFIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DevelopmentCosts" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_us-gaap_ServiceMember67803171" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">317</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand and $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--DevelopmentCosts_pn3n3_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--RelatedDevelopmentCostsMember_zEGmNcXsHPjk" title="Development costs" class="xdx_phnt_RGlzY2xvc3VyZSAtICBTQ0hFRFVMRSBPRiBESVNBR0dSRUdBVElPTiBPRiBSRVZFTlVFIChEZXRhaWxzKSAoUGFyZW50aGV0aWNhbCkA"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:DevelopmentCosts" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_RelatedDevelopmentCostsMember" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-3" scale="3" unitRef="USD">180</ix:nonFraction></span> thousand,
